  "humanity_exists_in_10000": "uncertain",
  "summary": "Humanity's future is a perilous race between its accelerating technological power and its wisdom to control it. If we survive the existential threats of the next few centuries—climate change, AI, and biotechnology—our descendants will likely spread throughout the solar system and beyond. This expansion will inevitably lead to the fragmentation of humanity into a diverse collection of post-human species, where the original meaning of 'human' is lost to time."
